      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s historic Canyon Road, also called “The Great Plank Road,” ran under the Vista Bridge and was key to early transportation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
