      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The MAX Light Rail cuts through Goose Hollow, stopping at Providence Park and the Goose Hollow/SW Jefferson St stations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
