      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goose_Hollow%2C_Portland%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tanner Creek was buried underground in the 1890s, and the gulch was filled, reshaping the neighborhood’s landscape.",
